# Space with a key after 150 ms gives Meta and that key. AC-5.
0 in key KEY_SPACE down
200 in key KEY_A down
200 out key KEY_LEFTMETA down
200 out key KEY_A down
250 in key KEY_A repeat
250 out key KEY_A repeat
300 in key KEY_A up
300 out key KEY_A up
300 out key KEY_LEFTMETA up
400 in key KEY_SPACE up
